.# The code tags generated for monospace (see monospace1.test) are read back as monospace
.#-----------------------------------------------------
a <code>b **c** _d_ [e](https://www.xwiki.org) \*f\* \`g\` \</code> \<b></code>h

<code><br/>i</code> j

